982 < 2 def test_c_both_report_paths_are_requested_as_api_reads_of_the_evidence_tag(
983 < 2         tmp_path):
984 < 2     """(c)/[M1]: exactly `repos/ops/evidence/contents/runs/o-r/131/report.json
985 < 2     ?ref=o-r/run-131` and its 132 twin, each once, each an `api`
986 < 2     call naming exactly two arguments — the shape the two existing fetches
987 < 2     already use."""
